  "name": "channel-inbox-event",
  "description": "Append-only inbox of provider-verified channel webhook deliveries, one row per (space, connection, provider event id) (backlog:e5532d1c9146). Generalizes the M11 signature inbox to any channel adapter: verification before any write, DB-unique event identity plus payload fingerprint, quarantine for unknown subjects, an explicit effect per row, and a stable refusal that echoes nothing. Rows stored by the progressive initial history import carry that import's importKey (null for webhook rows), so a replayed page derives stored-by-this-import instead of recounting it.",
